From: meta-exein <thomas@exein.io>
Subject: [PATCH] Cargo.lock: bump openssl/openssl-sys for OpenSSL 4.x

Yocto Blacksail ships OpenSSL 4.0.2. The versions locked by Pulsar 0.10.0
cannot build against it:

  * openssl-sys 0.9.109 aborts in its build script -- "This crate is only
    compatible with OpenSSL (version 1.0.1 through 1.1.1, or 3)". 0.9.117
    accepts 1.1.0, 1.1.1, 3.x and 4.x.

  * openssl 0.10.73 then fails to compile against 0.9.117: OpenSSL 4 made
    several X509/ASN1 accessors return const pointers, 0.9.117 reflects
    that, and 0.10.73 still expects *mut (E0308, three sites in
    src/x509/mod.rs). 0.10.81 carries the matching signatures and requires
    openssl-sys ^0.9.117.

Lockfile-only change; no Cargo.toml edit is needed:

  * the workspace requires openssl "0.10.73" (^0.10.73, permits 0.10.81)
  * native-tls 0.2.14 requires openssl ^0.10.69 and openssl-sys ^0.9.81
  * openssl 0.10.81 requires openssl-sys ^0.9.117
  * no crates are added or removed; 0.10.81 drops its once_cell
    dependency, which other crates still pull in

Note that tls-rustls is not an alternative here: smtp-notifier lists
lettre with the "tokio1-native-tls" feature unconditionally and defaults
to the "openssl" feature, so openssl-sys stays in the graph either way.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: meta-exein <thomas@exein.io>

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 2f9e9fe..2516721 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -2186,15 +2186,14 @@ checksum = "a4895175b425cb1f87721b59f0f286c2092bd4af812243672510e1ac53e2e0ad"
 
 [[package]]
 name = "openssl"
-version = "0.10.73"
+version = "0.10.81"
 source = "registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"
-checksum = "8505734d46c8ab1e19a1dce3aef597ad87dcb4c37e7188231769bd6bd51cebf8"
+checksum = "77823a27f0babb03091cb9ed9ef80af3b39dbc82f97e8fa530374b7dafd87a45"
 dependencies = [
  "bitflags",
  "cfg-if",
  "foreign-types",
  "libc",
- "once_cell",
  "openssl-macros",
  "openssl-sys",
 ]
@@ -2227,9 +2226,9 @@ dependencies = [
 
 [[package]]
 name = "openssl-sys"
-version = "0.9.109"
+version = "0.9.117"
 source = "registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index"
-checksum = "90096e2e47630d78b7d1c20952dc621f957103f8bc2c8359ec81290d75238571"
+checksum = "b47e7e6bb2c38cd930d25a23b40fa52e068c10e85f3e03a7f5ba5aaca5713695"
 dependencies = [
  "cc",
  "libc",
